text: ['At the beginning of your end step, you may exile target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Deathtouch, lifelink\\nWhen Wurmcoil Engine dies, create a 3/3 colorless Phyrexian Wurm artifact creature token with deathtouch and a 3/3 colorless Phyrexian Wurm artifact creature token with lifelink.', 'Look at the top six cards of your library. Put up to two creature cards with mana value 3 or less from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', '{T}, Sacrifice Fabled Passage: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Then if you control four or more lands, untap that land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Untap target Forest.']
flavor: ['"Skeletons? You should be so lucky."\\n—Gisa, to Geralf', 'The stones, like their holders, were drawn to each other. United, their true power awoke.']
artist: ['Howard Lyon', 'Jason Felix', 'Johann Bodin', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Raymond Swanland', 'rk post']
